<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-CAMERLIN SELLS NATIONAL FOODS STAKE.</title>
<headline>RTRS-CAMERLIN SELLS NATIONAL FOODS STAKE.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1997-08-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Singapore-based investment group Camerlin Pte Ltd had sold its stake of about 10 percent in National Foods Ltd to a range of institutions on Thursday, broking sources told Reuters.</p>
</text>
